# Arashin Sunshield: "When this creature enters, exile up to two target cards from a single graveyard." Bot2 Bolts Bot1 on
# turns 2 and 4, so Bot2's graveyard holds two Lightning Bolts, and Bot1's own graveyard holds a Bolt. On turn 5 Bot1 casts the
# Sunshield ({3}{W} from four Moxes): the first target is a Bolt of Bot2's; the Bolt from Bot1's graveyard cannot be the second
# (the refusal beside the allowed second card from the same graveyard), so Bot2's other Bolt is. Both are exiled and Bot1's Bolt
# stays.

